  "bodyHash": "7mXZWUGBqyw=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">聰</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">明&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">農</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">夫</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">聰明農夫是一個非常簡單的模組，讓農夫不再那麼笨</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您可以將此模組與其他會改變農夫行為的模組一起安裝，而這個模組的邏輯將始終優先。</p><p><strong>請記得開啟生物破壞（mob griefing），否則農夫將無法執行任何動作！</strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">農夫現在可以：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與模組農作物互動、種植和重新種植</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">根據邏輯重新種植作物。他們不再會隨便拿起第一顆種子，而是會嘗試重新種植剛剛收成的作物</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果沒有作物需要重新種植，農夫會根據周圍的作物選擇一種新的作物來種植。你的小麥田裡再也不會出現孤零零的胡蘿蔔塊了！</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">接受並拾取這些作物的種子，並阻止非農夫村民做同樣的事</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在執行收成任務時會裝備鋤頭。其品質取決於村民的等級</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在種植時會裝備他們即將種植的種子。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不再會踩壞農田</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以以棋盤式圖案種植南瓜和西瓜。他們夠聰明，不會用另一種作物擋住現有南瓜作物的空氣方塊。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以在非原版農田的方塊上種植和重新種植，可透過「farmer_plantable_on」標籤進行調整。預設包含類似 Supplementaries 模組中種植盆的方塊</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以收成特殊的非作物類方塊，可透過「crop_replaceable」標籤進行調整。預設包含 Immersive Weathering 的雜草以及 Overweight Farming 和 Hefty Crops 的大型作物方塊</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">對甜莓灌木叢的傷害免疫</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任務失敗的機率大幅降低，整體反應更靈敏<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，所有村民現在都會接受並與您丟給他們的任何（模組）食物進行繁殖<br><br>同時還內建了<strong>除錯渲染器</strong>，您可以在配置中啟用，以精確查看農夫在想什麼。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組製作佔用了我很多時間，所以如果您喜歡我的作品，並想支持我，您可以在這裡這麼做。如果支持，您將獲得專屬於您的<strong>客製化地球儀</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果您使用「supplementaries」代碼從 Akliz 購買伺服器，也同樣適用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看 Akliz，他們擁有專為模組 Minecraft 設計的一流伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們社群溫馨，支援服務出色，伺服器運行順暢</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代碼「supplementaries」可享<strong>8折優惠</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
